title: "Galactic Cosmic Ray Corotating Interaction Region Modeling Tools: a SPECTRUM fork"
abstract: "This software is a specialization of the Space Plasma and Energetic Charged particle TRansport on Unstructured Meshes (SPECTRUM) code to modeling the modulation of galactic cosmic rays in corotating interaction regions."
